      "mergeID": "64540d2bdac5b0f260baf0e2",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Enabling avatar culling with someone's avatar hidden, before blocking someone, causes their hitbox to be pinned in place, making it easy to cheat most pvp-centric worlds.",
