      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6452e4fb81b006093371451e|full_name}: Project Aincrad dev here, we actually also uses a pill-style hitbox :)\n\nIf blocking avatars causes their hitbox to freeze something else is most likely breaking as we just use head tracking data to move the collider. I’ll add this to our bug tracker as well so we can look into it some more.\n\nEdit: reading this again makes me realize its avatar culling that causes it, not avatar blocking. @{5b7fb61894211b58b866e8ae|full_name} could this be solved by still updating tracking data when avatars are culled?",
