  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-03-11T19:39:44.833Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I along with the people I know well, block people who cross certain lines. Regardless of what worlds we're in, like game worlds, even though it makes the games difficult for us.\n\nPreviously though, if you could track down where a blocked player was, you could still win the game in murder4 and prison escape.\n\nI believe as of roughly 2 updates ago, 1284 or 1285, player's hitboxes no longer track once they have been blocked.\n\nThis means you can't win under certain conditions, or the opposite, where you can win early by blocking people before the game starts, and they all register as outside the game.\n\nWhile it'd be understandable to unblock these people and play the game with them muted or avatars hidden, not only does this make toxic behavior not as punishable, but also makes VRChats moderation options less reliable.\n\nBlocking should always be an available option for safety, and a game should NEVER force you to unblock a user you don't feel comfortable with.",
